{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve the released invocation-end ordering contract.** `withPlugins` previously promised every hook in registration order, so reversing all existing plugins here makes a patch upgrade reorder MDC, thread-local, and resource cleanup; one plugin may now observe or tear down another plugin's state at the wrong phase. Keep forward order for existing plugins, or introduce an explicit/versioned LIFO opt-in for scope-owning plugins with compatibility coverage.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc773sSb","finding_digest":"6a6a364423079980f182e8d5380ffe41cbf54169c4fd16e9b84450553a2a3bdc","finding_id":"arf_v1_njvdmrbda6myb4mc5dktqd76ih","finding_key":"sdk/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","line":112,"observation_digest":"7880f42b8369d295c8f0d9cb295b756e1a2f022d2557f2db891a94b3f9c4b0de","observation_id":"aro_v1_pcapik4dnhjjlshq3hfssw3vny","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_njvdmrbda6myb4mc5dktqd76ih","published_at":"2026-10-09T01:06:52Z","review_id":"arr_v1_xtc4mdccw6xznqcvuaqflguugt","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"0e55c1a11999121bdc5bae521f92975724822b43","reviewer":"codex","start_line":110,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":771},"record_id":"art_v1_qtrkt4ypflpcn2hmwvvhsisdl4","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T01:06:52Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
